cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Boletus, please credit it as below."
title: "Boletus"
abstract: >-
  A Rhino 8 / Grasshopper front-end for the DualC implicit-field engine: components
  compose a field-graph of TPMS and strut lattices, primitives, booleans and warps,
  preview it in the viewport or a GPU side-car, and export a printable STL or 3MF.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Giacomo
    family-names: Forcina
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Giacogiak/Boletus"
